e) computed with another ASR, Qwen3-ASR-1.7B, which never scored a training candidate: a pass shows that the reward's gain in ASR-judged reading accuracy transfers to an independent ASR on held-out texts and voices, not a general naturalness or quality gain; the two ASRs can share biases (05 section 6.1, R15-1)","reward":"wer_whisper_canon: canon-1 WER (wer_canon.py) of Whisper-large-v3-turbo's transcript, the ranking of the DPO pairs (eval/score_candidates.py)","statement":"wer_qwen_canon is the training reward's formula (canon-1 WER against the item's reference) computed with another ASR, Qwen3-ASR-1.7B, which never scored a training candidate. A pass shows fewer ASR-judged reading errors on these categories (numbers, money, units, dates, abbreviations, names, long sentences) that transfer to an independent ASR on held-out texts and voices, not a general naturalness gain; the two ASRs can share biases. The deciding ASR was used on the dev set for checkpoint selection. The test texts come from the same kind of programmatic templates as the training texts (disjoint templates and lexicon) plus held-out LibriTTS-R test_clean sentences. This test set was already scored for an earlier candidate of this recipe (published 2026-11-17)."},"consumption_precision":"row","contamination":{"allowed":false,"exact_overlap":0},"created_at":"2026-11-18T03:37:35.488Z","disjoint_from":"not-assessed (skeleton)","eval_distribution":{"env_params_version":null,"env_version":null,"item_set_hash":"sha256:b4d2fed80f33a5e1c53714589b4bf8285ebc4c7f4e4a36e5589aa4f587b63dc2"},"family_alpha":"not-assessed (skeleton)","gate_id":"quality_gate","gpu_seconds":240,"incomplete_cuts":[],"independence_tier":["T3","T3"],"item_set_hash":"sha256:b4d2fed80f33a5e1c53714589b4bf8285ebc4c7f4e4a36e5589aa4f587b63dc2","joint_power_independent":0.6400000000000001,"lockfile_hash":"sha256:2ef4dc16b923bc9e975b04e7268a5233a5b45f0c8c22ecb55d91d8a0ab369f9c","multiplicity":"all_clauses_must_pass","notes":["Consumption preci